# Title: PUA - Chisel Tunneling Tool Execution
# ID: 8b0e12da-d3c3-49db-bb4f-256703f380e5
# Status: test
# Level: high
# Author: Florian Roth (Nextron Systems)
# Date: 2022-09-13
# Tags: attack.command-and-control, attack.t1090.001
# Description: Detects usage of the Chisel tunneling tool via the commandline arguments
# Converted by: Sigma Universal SIEM/EDR CLI

((Image="*\\chisel.exe") OR (((CommandLine contains "exe client " OR CommandLine contains "exe server ")) AND ((CommandLine contains "-socks5" OR CommandLine contains "-reverse" OR CommandLine contains " r:" OR CommandLine contains ":127.0.0.1:" OR CommandLine contains "-tls-skip-verify " OR CommandLine contains ":socks"))))
